  "description": "Have you ever become a human being crawling on the prison floor with its limbs severed? The cowardly Prince Cheongpung, who fainted at the brutal sight of the Imperial Palace duel, was more devastating than imagined. He watched with his eyes open as his mother died between the bars, with his limbs severed, falsely accused of poisoning his father and the emperor. When the breath within that deep resentment was cut off - heaven protected me, and I was reborn. In the midst of a battle rife with bizarre weapons, in the body of the Vice-Chairman of the Demonic Cult. Damn the world, this time I'll trample on you! -\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000078276), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13854471), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/69106589)",
